## Memory discipline

- **Recall before deciding.** Run the recall map at session start; recall again
  before any decision that a past preference, failure or convention could inform.
  `voidloom batch-recall --items '["…","…"]' --top-k 10 --json`
- **Store as you go**, not only at the end: decisions and why, errors and their
  fixes, preferences the human states. Dual-layer: the fact, then the why.
  `voidloom batch-store --items @file.json --json`
- Tag persona-relevant memories `persona:{{FOLDER}}`.

